ssh3-c (0.4.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The openssh(8)-canon package split: the source now builds three
    binary packages - ssh3-client (the /usr/bin/ssh3 CLI with its
    fresh ssh3(1) man page), ssh3-server (the socket-activated
    daemon, Depends on the matching ssh3-client) and the ssh3c
    metapackage pulling the pair at matching versions (the `ssh'
    metapackage analog).
  * The drop-in conflict dance follows the split: ssh3-client
    Conflicts/Replaces ssh3-go-client, ssh3-server does the same
    against ssh3-go-server; the bundled deb/rpm/apk of build.sh
    declare the same against the split go packages.

 -- Max <nahual15@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:00:00 +0000

